The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macbook-neo/">MacBook Neo</a> is now Apple's entry-level MacBook, undercutting the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macbook-air/">MacBook Air</a> by &#36;500. To deliver such a dramatically lower price, the &zwnj;MacBook Neo&zwnj; has a significant number of tradeoffs. Here's everything that's different between the two devices.<br/>
<br/>
